{"id": "JAH-SIG-CONDITIO-000001", "slug": "tool-condition-checker-signature", "title": "Condition Checker \u2014 Overview and definition", "edition": "signature", "src": "signature-generated-completion", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "tool database record", "ladder_rank": 1, "body": "Signature edition. Original Signature methods and framings developed for the JAH system, labeled Signature throughout. Evaluates conditions before allowing an action. The Condition Checker evaluates true/false conditions \u2014 comparisons, membership tests, threshold checks \u2014 before an action is allowed to proceed. It is the gatekeeper other tools call: 'is the file present?', 'is the value in range?', 'has the user approved?'. Every evaluation returns the condition, the result, and the evidence.", "capabilities": ["Boolean, comparison, and range conditions", "Compound AND/OR/NOT logic", "Evidence attached to every verdict", "Pre-action gating for other tools", "Condition libraries for reuse"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Tool overview and capability inventory", "code": "J({tool:TOOL.name,capabilities:TOOL.capabilities,count:TOOL.capabilities.length});assert(TOOL.capabilities.length>=5,'caps');", "verified_output": "{\"tool\":\"Condition Checker\",\"capabilities\":[\"Boolean, comparison, and range conditions\",\"Compound AND/OR/NOT logic\",\"Evidence attached to every verdict\",\"Pre-action gating for other tools\",\"Condition libraries for reuse\"],\"count\":5}", "verified_at": "2026-10-21", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_paste": "catalog-100-basic-pc-ai-tools-2026-10-21.txt", "last_verified": "2026-10-21", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_comple